</style>
<h2>Asobi 0.8 (build 688)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Only people I invite can join.</b> A new checkbox under Personal links in the Shared Review panel. On, the relay seats only the people in your list, plus your Mac: the share link stops working, anyone who came in on it leaves straight away and is told to ask for their own link, and the review&#8217;s media is refused to anyone without an invite. Off, the ordinary link-and-passphrase share works exactly as before.</li>
<li><b>One browser per person</b> (optional): the first browser to open a personal link is the only one, until you press Reset.</li>
<li>What it can&#8217;t do is take back what someone has already watched or saved. Withdrawing someone closes their connection immediately; media already being fetched elsewhere can take up to 20 seconds to follow.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
